<script>
/*
  Her soru nesnesi şu alanları destekler:
    num         : soru numarası (1–10)
    instruction : soru talimatı (üstte gösterilir)
    imgSide     : sol panel HTML — <img> veya .q-text-box / .q-table kombinasyonu
    topContent  : (opsiyonel) şıkların üstüne eklenen ek HTML (ikinci görsel vb.)
    question    : soru kökü metni
    options     : [A, B, C, D] metinleri — HTML de olabilir (görsel şıklar için)
    ans         : doğru şık harfi 'A' | 'B' | 'C' | 'D'
    optLayout   : (opsiyonel) 'grid2x2' → şıklar 2×2 grid'de gösterilir
*/
const TEST_QUESTIONS = [
  {
    num: 1,
    instruction: 'Read the text below and answer the question.',
    imgSide: `<div class="q-text-box"><p>Scientists work hard to understand the universe. Nicolaus Copernicus realized that the Earth orbits the Sun. He also discovered that the Earth spins on its axis. He worked on his theory for many years and finally published it in 1543. It took a long time for people to accept his ideas after he passed away, but today we know that he was right.</p></div>`,
    question: 'According to the paragraph, Copernicus - - - -.',
    options: [
      'became famous before he died',
      'discovered that the Sun spins on its axis',
      'shared his theory with everyone immediately',
      'developed his theory for a long time and introduced it'
    ],
    ans: 'D'
  },
  {
    num: 2,
    instruction: 'Read the text below and answer the question.',
    imgSide: `<div class="q-text-box"><p>Johannes Gutenberg was born in 1398 in Germany. He developed the printing press in 1450. Before Gutenberg, people could print only 40-50 pages with the old method. With his invention, thousands of pages could be printed every day. Thanks to the printing press, knowledge and education spread throughout Europe easily.</p></div>`,
    question: 'In this paragraph, there is NO information about Gutenberg\'s - - - -.',
    options: ['family life', 'birth year', 'home country', 'famous invention'],
    ans: 'A',
    optLayout: 'grid2x2'
  },
  {
    num: 3,
    instruction: 'Read the text below and answer the question.',
